  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening long-term sea turtle conservation programs in the Yucatan Peninsula to improve adaptive management and decision making.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The recipient will conduct night patrols to survey and protect nesting sea turtles from April 1 - September 30 along 81 km of nesting beaches at Celestun, El Cuyo and Holbox as well as outreach and eduaction activities with local communities.</narrative>
  </description>
